<div class="container"><div class="page-head"><h1>About SDUT Swap</h1></div>
<div class="panel" style="max-width:820px">
<p>SDUT Swap — <strong>Your Campus. Your Marketplace.</strong> — is a student-to-student marketplace built for university communities. Students buy and sell textbooks, electronics, dorm essentials, and more, trading with verified classmates on their own campus.</p>
<p>Every seller verifies their Student Card before listing. All conversations happen on-platform, and every listing, user, and conversation can be reported. Our support team reviews reports and tickets so SDUT Swap stays safe and trustworthy.</p>
<p>Meet on campus, inspect items before paying, and keep it friendly. That's the SDUT Swap way.</p>
</div></div>
